          "order": 1,
          "title": "Providing Review on VRBO- Instructions",
          "instructions": "• On check-out day, you’ll receive an email with a link to submit a review if you’ve met the property review requirements. You can also submit your review from your account.\n• Submit a review\n• Log in to your Vrbo account with the email used to book the property.\n• Select My Trips under your profile name.\n• Select your specific reservation from past trips.\n• Select Leave a Review.\n• Rate your experience from 1 to 5 stars (lowest to highest rating) and fill in the required fields.\n• Select Submit.\n•",
          "type": "normal",
          "branches": []
