        "description": "Family Getaway Less than 5 miles from Disney!",
        "information": "Address: 2758 Sun Key Place, Kissimmee, Florida 34747, United States | Unit type: SINGLE-UNIT | Tags: Emerald Island, Townhouse, Lake View, Themed Rooms, 3 Bedrooms, Villakey, Theme Room"
