              "id": "villakey-paradise-palms-8917-procedure-001-step-2",
              "order": 2,
              "title": "CHECK IN \\ ARRIVAL details - PARADISE PALMS",
              "instructions": "•\n• ARRIVAL\n• Please make sure to locate the main entrance of the resort where the guard is located. If you have returned your Rental Agreement, your name should be pre registered with the gate. Just in case, have a printed or digital copy of your agreement and/or booking confirmation handy.\n• ENTERING THE HOMEOnce you arrive at the home you may park your car in the driveway. On the front door you will see a keypad. You will enter the code we provide you on the day before check-in. This will provide you access to the home for the length of your stay.",
