              "instructions": "• If guests are shipping anything to the home:  Owners, renters, guests, and residents must show a valid picture ID to receive packages. Owners, permanent residents, and long-term renters (lease greater than six months) are NOT charged package storage fees. All packages delivered to the Clubhouse for short-term renters and guests are subject to a $10.00 package storage fee. Any mail with tracking numbers are considered packages. The fee of $10.00 (each) pertains to all packages regardless of size or shape.Oversized packages and those weighing over 30 pounds are not accepted at the Clubhouse. Kindly make arrangements to have someone available to accept delivery of the package(s) at your home for oversized and/or heavy items.Packages will be held for up to 30 days. Packages not picked up within the time limit will be discarded.",
              "type": "normal",
