              "title": "Parking rules- Solterra",
              "instructions": "• No Parking in the grass anywhere on the resort, including yards. Street Parking is designated by Marked Spaces in between 2 White Lines. Parking is on a first-come, first-serve basis. Only guests may park overnight. All visitor passes expire at 10:00 PM",
