              "id": "villakey-solterra-4679-procedure-003-step-2",
              "order": 2,
              "title": "Parking details - SOLTERRA",
              "instructions": "• PARKING PERMITS REQUIRED FOR STREET PARKING\n• Two cars permitted per driveway. Permits are required for street parking or in a lot, and MUST be placed in the windshield. If a vehicle has already been on property, you must return to get a permit. To claim a pass you must show a hard copy or email of your reservation confirmation (no texts or screenshots). If you do not qualify for a permit you will get a temporary entry pass and must either park in the driveway of the home or leave by 10pm. Otherwise, your CAR IS AT RISK TO BE TOWED. If guests will be arriving in separate vehicles, be sure someone from each vehicle is shown as a registered guest.\n• Don’t get towed! Parking limits are strictly enforced.\n• Two cars per driveway or in designated parking areas.\n• Check at the clubhouse for more information.\n• Never park on the grass or block traffic!\n• Parking on the street is only allowed in marked spaces.\n• An overnight parking permit is required on Friday and Saturday nights.\n• Motorcycles must be parked in a garage.\n• Towing is strictly enforced 24 hours per day.\n• Bolton’s Towing Phone # - 863-299-9966",
              "type": "normal",
