              "title": "Solterra - Gate Access",
              "instructions": "• Updated solterra login for Propita 2.0.\n• ﻿reservations@myvillakey.com\n• Password:\n• Villaresort2026@#$22\n• URL: https://portal.proptia.com\n• Please note the team reported an issue, but will need your help while the developers find a solution, see below:You can work around this current error by changing the start date to a different date than the original start date assigned when the Add Visitor Form pops up. You can then change the Start date to any date, including the original date, and the end date can then be edited to any date within the 45 day Pass Parameters. The proportia Website for Solterra changed over night , please see email from the HOA, you will need to use the new links, there is also videos on how to use th website, please let me know if you have any questions. Good Morning, Solterra Resort Homeowners and Property Managers,\n• Exciting news, Propita has upgraded to 2.0. This migration took place overnight last night, 3/5/25. Please see below for some important information from Proptia.\n• Old links will not work please utilize the link provided below. Current usernames and passwords transferred to 2.0, please log in using these credentials.\n• What to Expect\n• New URL Link for Proptia 2.0: Access Proptia 2.0 directly at\n• http://portal.proptia.com/en-us/proptia/accounts/password/setup/key/2skf-cp713y-3b1b29fae783867b708643ee82507040/\n• Please update any bookmarks or saved links.\n• Mobile App Updates:\n• iOS: https://apps.apple.com/us/app/proptia-2-0/id6504521097\n• Android: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.proptia.android.resident\n• Website Login Changes: The \"Login\" button on Proptia.com will no longer work for Proptia 1.0 after the migration. Your Username and password will be the same in Proptia 2.0.\n• Training Resources: We’ve prepared training videos to help you get started quickly:\n• Homeowner How To’s: https://proptia.odoo.com/homeowner-support\n• Property Manager How To’s: https://proptia.odoo.com/pm-knowledgebase\n• Benefits of Proptia 2.0: Enjoy improved functionality, enhanced user experience, and new features designed to make your work easier.\n• Reference Material:\n• Proptia 2.0 Overview\" Video here: https://youtu.be/LM7sHvzDHjw?si=Rlor3IPHAvZ0IqMT\n• Video here: https://youtu.be/LM7sHvzDHjw\n• Proptia YouTube Channel: https://www.youtube.com/@proptia8085\n• We are excited about this upgrade and look forward to supporting you during this transition.\n• Sincerely, Proptia Customer Success Team\n• Please find the video on how to register guests in Solterra using the new URL link. ScreenRecording_03-10-2025 14-48-28_1.MP4\n•",
