                      "instructions": "• When Guests would like to access the amenities at The Hideaway Club or at The Bronson Club, each person is required to sign in and show proof of stay at the concierge desk. This is for everyone's safety and to ensure nobody outside of Storey Lake is trying to access the clubhouse amenities. The concierge is required to see the confirmation of stay from the booking website used, their orange parking pass, or the DwellingLIVE QR code that has the property address on it. Once the address is confirmed, all guests that are 18+ will receive a colored wristband. The wristband is only valid for one day, which means, if guests would like to access the clubhouse every day, they will need to check in at the front desk.",
                      "type": "normal"
