              "order": 1,
              "title": "Trash details - STOREY LAKE",
              "instructions": "• TRASH PICKUP\n• Trash pickup 7 days a week, 12PM-5PM\n• Place trash in bin before 11:45am for pick up the same day\n• All Trash must be bagged, tied and placed inside the trash bin near the front door\n• No loose trash in bin (loose trash will not be picked up)\n• Trash that cannot hold inside the bin should be taken to the dumpster near the clubhouse.\n•\n• During Check-out:\n• TRASH - Place all trash in tied bags in the bin by the front door. Trash that cannot hold inside the bin should be taken to the dumpster. Any leftover food in packages may be left in the home and our housekeeping team will take care of it.",
              "type": "normal",
              "branches": []
