              "instructions": "• TERRA VERDE ---\n• amenities Check in this link ( guest message: how much is the resort fee?\n• The community does not charge a resort fee but does charge a resort parking access card for each car. The cost is $20.00 per card. ) https://www.terraverderesort.net/userfiles/Resort%20Policies%202023.pdf\n•\n• The HOA now requires that guests and anyone going into the community be sent via text to the security via text phone number, that number only receives text messages. The number is 1- 833-302-0243.  You will be putting the guest's name, the address they are going to . I know sometimes we ask for you to add vendors, then you would put vendor.\n• 4706 Vero Beach Place\n• 4733 Vero Beach Place",
