              "title": "Trash details - TERRA VERDE",
              "instructions": "• TRASH - Place all trash in tied bags in the bin by the front door. Trash that cannot hold inside the bin should be taken to the dumpster. Any leftover food in packages may be left in the home and our housekeeping team will take care of it.\n• TRASH PICKUP\n• Trash pickup Monday-Saturday\n• Place trash in bin before 6am for pick up the same day\n• All Trash must be bagged, tied and placed inside the trash bin near the front door\n• No loose trash in bin (loose trash will not be picked up)\n• Trash that cannot hold inside the bin should be taken to the dumpster near the clubhouse.",
