              "title": "Clubhouse pool/ Spa house:",
              "instructions": "• The Vista Cay Resort heated pool opens from 8.00 AM to 11.00 PM daily. However, hours are subject to change so be sure to check at the clubhouse before making any plans for the day.\n• Please make sure to bring the amenity passes located inside the unit to the pool area.\n• The amenity passes for the pool are right by the entrance of the home and look like room key cards for a hotel. I believe there is a pizza ad on one side of the card.\n• Only one amenity pass is needed per group.\n•\n• ###Still open as of July 11###",
