              "title": "Check-out- WINDSOR AT WESTSIDE",
              "instructions": "• Checkout time is 10AM! Here are your instructions.\n• TRASH - Place all trash in tied bags in the bin by the front door. Trash that cannot hold inside the bin should be taken to the dumpster. Any leftover food in packages may be left in the home and our housekeeping team will take care of it.\n• DIRTY DISHES - Please place all dirty dishes in the dishwasher and start the wash cycle.\n• LOST ITEMS - Please check to make sure you have removed all personal and valuable items. Unfortunately, VillaKey cannot take responsibility for mailing your items to you.\n• LOCKS - Please make sure all windows and doors are locked!\n• Hopefully you enjoyed your stay and can leave a five star review! Please let us know if you have any feedback for us.\n•",
