                      "instructions": "• Pool/Spa Heating is one system that is available for an additional fee. The cost is $40 per day plus tax, pool heating must be added for the duration of your stay if you are staying less than a week. If you are staying a week or more, we have a 7-day minimum on pool heat. If you are adding pool heating on the day of your arrival or less than 24 hours before your check-in time, you will also be charged a one-time turn-on fee of $45 plus tax. It will take up to 24 hours for the pool to heat up fully.\n• Please note that the pool water will only heat up 10-15 degrees warmer than the temperature outside and will not be effective if the air temperature goes below 55˚.\n• Also, please check if home photos have a spa/pool or only a pool, if home only has a pool, remove part about spa from above ####\n• So if guest is coming in summer, NF is better. SF pools get quite warm in summer.",
