              "instructions": "• IG will now be empowered to add guests at the gate, using the Gate Access Instructions.pdf (log-in info and training)\n• ﻿IG information for Gates.pdf\n•\n• Bella Vida does have a website: https://bellavida.gatehouseportal.com/\n• Gate Access is Not Required for the below listing (Updated 12/12/2024)\n• Vista Cay\n• Solara\n• Westside\n• The Fountains 8197\n• Caribe Cove\n• ● Vista Cay- This community has a community gate, the guest does not need\n• to be added to any gates. The guest needs to enter 6358 # and the gate will\n• open. ( The new gate code is 1967#, which is currently working. Guests may still use 6358# until April 1 )\n• ● Solara - This is a manned gate so the guest just needs to go into the complex\n• and let the security guard know where they are and they will be allowed in,\n• they should have their rental agreement, ready to present. They will be\n• advised to go to the clubhouse to register their vehicle.\n• ● Westside. The guest will receive a gate code prior to arrival. Here are the\n• codes for each home:\n• Property Code Gate Code\n• Westside 1881 28325\n• Westside 2483 38906\n• Westside 8883 19486\n• Westside 8886 98559\n• Westside 8897 41097\n• ● The Fountains 8197 The gate code is 1930. ( New code updated)\n• Caribe Cove - The guest  use a code, this is the code for all future bookings:   #9285",
