          "steps": [
            {
              "id": "villakey-westside-1881-procedure-004-step-1",
              "order": 1,
              "title": "Parking details - WINDSOR AT WESTSIDE",
              "instructions": "• Don’t get towed! Parking limits are strictly enforced.\n• 5-vehicle limit per single family home and a 3-vehicle limit per townhome.\n• Parked vehicles cannot park on any portion of the grass.\n• Parked vehicles cannot block driveways or any portion of the sidewalk.\n• No commercial vehicles, refrigeration trucks, recreational vehicles, all-terrain vehicles, boats, watercraft, buses, or trailers are allowed in the community.\n• Windsor at Westside does not have an overflow parking lot.\n• Violators will be towed at the vehicle owner’s expense without notice.\n•",
              "type": "normal",
              "branches": []
            }
          ],
          "completionInstruction": "Complete all applicable steps and required communication, system update, charge, escalation, or documentation before closing the procedure."
