              "order": 1,
              "title": "Parking details- WINDSOR HILLS",
              "instructions": "• There is a THREE CAR MAXIMUM per Windsor Hills property address - exceptions MUST be approved PRIOR to arrival. Please notify us via your booking app or reservations@myvillakey.com if you expect more than 3 cars.\n• Parked vehicles CANNOT block sidewalks.\n• Parked vehicles CANNOT park on the streets or grass.\n• There are only TWO vehicles allowed to be parked in the driveway - additional vehicles MUST park in the oversize parking lot or near the clubhouse.\n• Registered guests CANNOT share parking passes with unregistered guests. ​​\n• ​Vehicles can/will be towed at the vehicle's owner's expense by the Windsor Hills community if these rules are not followed.\n•",
