              "id": "villakey-windsor-hills-7754-procedure-003-step-4",
              "order": 4,
              "title": "VILLAKEY",
              "instructions": "• WINDSOR HILLS\n• SOLARA\n• WINDSOR AT WESTSIDE\n• STOREY LAKE\n• CHAMPIONSGATE\n• BELLA VIDA\n• VISTA CAY\n• EMERALD ISLAND\n• TERRA VERDE\n• PARADISE PALMS\n• ENCORE",
              "type": "normal",
